    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "上一段讲到「AlphaTensor」。现在把镜头转向「SayCan」，沿着这条故事线换一个问题：如果把「SayCan」拆开来看，真正改变研究方向的部分是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "storyline-sequence"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "大语言模型能够提出看似合理的高层计划，却不知道特定机器人在当前环境中能执行哪些动作。机器人策略掌握局部技能，却缺少理解开放式指令所需的语言知识。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-saycan-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "SayCan 对每个候选技能进行两次评分：语言模型判断它是否推进指令，价值函数判断机器人此刻能否执行。两者乘积决定下一项技能，环境变化后再重复这一过程。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-saycan-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 SayCan 视为基础模型与具身控制结合的早期重要蓝图，而不是让语言模型不受约束地规划。它对“有用性”和“可行性”的拆分，后来反复出现在视觉-语言-动作模型和机器人智能体中。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-saycan-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "回看「AlphaTensor」，再看「SayCan」，我们能听见同一个技术问题跨越年代后的回响。",
